<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your Roomies account. If this was you, click the link below to choose a new password. This link expires in 15 minutes.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Reset my password", edit_password_url(token: @user.generate_token_for(:password_reset)) %></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>